h the same  as in the two-seater 911 just as in an  airplane the buttons and knobs are all  within easy reach for the driver  indoors miss of all I know points out  that Porsche rates fuel consumption at  10.3 litres per hundred kilometers and  it's true as long as you're driving on  the Autobahn and don't exceed 140 km/h  but for city driving anything less than  15 liters is unrealistic and it's just  so much fun to hear the Porsche roar and  foam gasket and unhealthy that's blue  bond restriction compania de  you
 

